const END_PICTOS=[["Warming Up","On the Continent outside COASTAL CAVE's portal, defeat the enormous GROSSE TÊTE optional boss standing in front of the entrance. Warming Up is the victory reward.",["act2","Collectibles · Coastal Cave","Continent · before Old Lumière"],["swim"]],["Stay Marked","With Esquie's FLIGHT unlocked, enter FLYING MANOR and reach CENTRAL PLAZA Flag. Take the ELEVATOR beside the plaza to the merchant landing and purchase Stay Marked for 122,250 Chroma.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Longer Burn","At FLYING MANOR Central Plaza Flag take the adjacent ELEVATOR and reach the Gestral merchant. After winning his duel, buy Longer Burn for 142,625 Chroma.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Accelerating Shots","At FLYING MANOR Central Plaza Flag use the ELEVATOR to the upper merchant, challenge him and purchase Accelerating Shots for 89,650 Chroma.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Break Specialist","Inside FLYING MANOR reach CENTRAL PLAZA and take the ELEVATOR to the merchant. Win his duel to unlock stock and buy Break Specialist for 81,500 Chroma.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Charging Alteration","Inside FLYING MANOR fight the GARGANT optional boss, then use the GRAPPLE revealed behind its arena to reach Charging Alteration.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Clea's Life","Climb to the upper part of FLYING MANOR and defeat the optional superboss CLEA. Clea's Life drops from this encounter; this is not a shop item.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Empowering Break","At FLYING MANOR Central Plaza use the elevator to the upper area, then search around the CRULER enemy on the adjacent path for Empowering Break.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Energetic Healer","At FLYING MANOR CENTRAL PLAZA Flag take the LEFT-hand path and descend by the ROPE. Pick up Energetic Healer on the nearby lower ledge.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Energising Shots","In FLYING MANOR travel along the central boss route to the GOBLU encounter, defeat it and enter the ROOM directly adjacent to the arena to collect Energising Shots.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Energising Stun","In FLYING MANOR locate PAINT CAGE 18 and shoot its THREE nearby paint anomalies to open the cage. Claim Energising Stun from inside.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Gradient Breaker","In FLYING MANOR from CENTRAL PLAZA take the ELEVATOR to the merchant, win the duel and purchase Gradient Breaker for 97,800 Chroma.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Painter","In FLYING MANOR reach the encounter with the THREE ÉVÊQUES and look for the CLIMBABLE PLATFORM positioned ABOVE them. Climb to it to collect Painter.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Powerful Mark","From FLYING MANOR's CENTRAL PLAZA Flag follow the main road toward the GOBLU boss area; search the side path just before the fight to pick up Powerful Mark.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Protecting Shots","In FLYING MANOR enter from its Continent portal, use the nearby STAIRS, then take the descending ROPE to reach the lower section. Search the lower ledge around the rope landing for Protecting Shots.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Slowing Break","At FLYING MANOR's CENTRAL PLAZA Flag take the ELEVATOR up to the Gestral merchant. Win the duel and buy Slowing Break for 97,800 Chroma.",["endgame","Collectibles · Flying Manor","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Clea's Death","In the ENDLESS TOWER, clear the newly added challenge against CLEA UNLEASHED. It awards Clea's Death on victory; the original Clea in Flying Manor does not give this Picto.",["endgame","Collectibles · Endless Tower","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["First Life","In the ENDLESS TOWER complete the added CHROMATIC LAMPMASTER boss encounter. First Life is the victory reward.",["endgame","Collectibles · Endless Tower","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Critical Weakness","At the ENDLESS TOWER complete all three trials in each of the FIRST SIX stages, then claim Critical Weakness from the stage-clear reward.",["endgame","Collectibles · Endless Tower","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Energising Rush","In ENDLESS TOWER clear all trials through the END OF STAGE TWO; collect Energising Rush from the stage-clear rewards.",["endgame","Collectibles · Endless Tower","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Greater Powerless","At the ENDLESS TOWER finish every trial through STAGE TEN, then retrieve the Greater Powerless Picto from the completion rewards.",["endgame","Collectibles · Endless Tower","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Rush on Powerful","At the ENDLESS TOWER fully complete NINE stages and claim the Rush on Powerful reward. An alternative copy exists in Renoir's Drafts.",["endgame","Collectibles · Endless Tower","Optional regions, bosses and secret weapons"],["fly"]],["Alternating Critical","In VERSO'S DRAFTS enter CANDY LAND and at the ENTRANCE turn RIGHT into the bright BLUE TUNNEL instead of following the main route. Retrieve Alternating Critical at the end.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["AP Discount","Within VERSO'S DRAFTS fast-travel to RÊVERIE PATH Flag and locate the Gestral merchant. Purchase AP Discount for 217,000 Chroma.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Consuming Attack","At VERSO'S DRAFTS' RÊVERIE PATH Flag find the merchant by the parkour route and buy Consuming Attack for 130,200 Chroma.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Damage Share","In VERSO'S DRAFTS find the LAKE with the floating JUMPING RINGS and ascend the STAIRS alongside it. Defeat the TWO LICORNES guarding the landing to acquire Damage Share.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Double Third","At VERSO'S DRAFTS OPEN PLAYGROUND Flag, look DOWN the cliff directly below the flag and defeat the grouped Nevrons on that lower shelf. Double Third drops in the same encounter as Longer Break.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Empowering Jumps","In VERSO'S DRAFTS locate the SEESAW platforming challenge and finish the balancing course. Speak to the activity host if present to claim Empowering Jumps.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Empowered Healer","Within VERSO'S DRAFTS enter TWISTED WOODS and take the RIGHT fork, continuing until the side PARKOUR challenge. Finish the course to obtain Empowered Healer.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Feint","At VERSO'S DRAFTS GESTRAL CAROUSEL find the Gestral NPC beside the carousel and ask to try his PARRY challenge. Parry his full attack sequence to receive Feint.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Frenzy","From VERSO'S DRAFTS LICORNAPIEDS STATION Flag follow the route to the LICORNAPIEDS BOSS. Defeat it and claim Frenzy from the encounter rewards.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Gradient Overcharge","At VERSO'S DRAFTS RÊVERIE PATH Flag locate the side PARKOUR challenge and finish the route to its far LEFT endpoint. Pick up Gradient Overcharge there.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Gradient Parry","In VERSO'S DRAFTS TWISTED WOODS take the RIGHT-hand route, pass the enemy at the first turning and CLIMB the nearby LEDGE to Gradient Parry.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Longer Break","At VERSO'S DRAFTS OPEN PLAYGROUND Flag look DOWN to the small CLIFF SHELF just below the flag. Defeat the enemy GROUP there to obtain Longer Break and Double Third.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Slowing Attack","Inside VERSO'S DRAFTS reach the GESTRAL BATHS Flag. From the bathing pools explore the raised SIDE LEDGES to find Slowing Attack lying on one of the ledges.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["SOS Healing Tint","In VERSO'S DRAFTS find the LAKE with jumping rings. Locate the FRANCTALE enemy guarding the lakeside platform, defeat it and claim SOS Healing Tint.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]],["Trigger Happy","Inside VERSO'S DRAFTS find the optional GESTRAL BALLOON miniboss in the amusement area. Defeat it to collect the Trigger-Happy Picto, displayed as Trigger Happy in this checklist.",["update","Verso's Drafts"],["dive"]]];
